{
  "slug": "9th-wonder-says-he-would-team-with-thanos-aka-dr-dre-to-face-swizz-beatz-timbaland-in-producer-tag-team-verzuz",
  "postId": 74473,
  "title": "9th Wonder Says He Would Team With Thanos AKA Dr. Dre To Face Swizz Beatz & Timbaland In Producer Tag Team Verzuz",
  "htmlContent": "<!-- wp:image {\"id\":515169,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/df87e4bbb323974e843a1e3a97fd0968.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-515169\"/><figcaption>Pinterest<gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Last week Swizz Beatz and Timbaland jumped on Instagram Live after they had an offline conversation, and decided to make it public. They wanted to do a tag team type of Verzuz against other producer duos. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\"Me and Timb were having a conversation we were feeling like me and Timb Verzuz everybody. Me and Timb Verzuz anybody. Me and Timb Verzuz whoever,\" said Swizz Beatz.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Timbaland added, \"We are starting the tag team Verzuz.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.instagram.com/tv/CasaLUBgjhW/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"instagram\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-instagram wp-block-embed-instagram\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.instagram.com/tv/CasaLUBgjhW/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On Sunday evening, Grammy Award Winning Producer, 9th Wonder was on Clubhouse in the Facts Over Feelings room, when he was asked, If he had to pick one producer to team up with to face Timbaland and Swizz Beatz? Who would he pick? </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It didn't take long for him to name Dr. Dre. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\"I would pick Dr. Dre, it is not even close. I'm picking Thanos... No question!\" </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Speaking of Dre, he recently performed at the Super Bowl at Sofi- Stadium in Los Angeles with Eminem, Kendrick Lamar, Mary J. Bilge, 50 Cent, and Snoop Dogg. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/timbaland/\"><br></a><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></gwmw></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
